Rem Bouncing Ball Demo
Screen Open 0,320,256,16,Lowres
Curs Off : Cls 0
Flash Off : Hide

Set Rainbow 0,1,64,"","(1,3)"
Rainbow 0,10,30,20

X=160 : Y=100
DX=2 : DY=2

Do
   Ink Rnd(15)+1
   Circle X,Y,20
   Wait Vbl
   Ink 0
   Circle X,Y,20

   X=X+DX : Y=Y+DY

   If X<20 or X>300 Then DX=-DX
   If Y<20 or Y>236 Then DY=-DY
Loop
